# Store every text file with LF in the repository.
#
# The authoring machine runs Windows and CI runs both windows-latest and
# ubuntu-latest, so an unnormalized repository hands the two runners different
# bytes for the same file. Normalizing on the way in makes the stored content
# platform-independent; the working tree still gets whatever the checkout
# platform prefers.
#
# This replaces a much longer policy that pinned roughly sixty paths with
# `-text` so a byte-pinned audit chain (specs 026-034) could hash them. That
# chain was archived at the `archive/hermes-audit-chain` tag and removed from
# main, and nothing left in this repository hashes its own source files.
* text=auto
